WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:05.345
Click the menu bar icon, then the gear, to
reach Settings.

2
00:00:05.915 --> 00:00:09.873
Choose Sign out, and Scry Sync asks you to
confirm.

3
00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:15.033
It says your folder and files stay exactly
as they are,

4
00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:18.371
and pictures already in Scry stay there.

5
00:00:18.941 --> 00:00:25.407
Confirm, and Scry Sync signs this computer
out and returns to its sign-in screen.
